  "id": "crowder-peas-with-ham-and-bacon",
  "name": "Crowder Peas with Ham and Bacon",
  "subtitle": "Tender peas simmered with smoky meat and aromatics",
  "description": "Frozen crowder peas cook with bacon, ham, onion, bell pepper, and herbs for a savory Southern-inspired side dish.",
